# Templates explorer — app

The "learn by example" explorer: presents the example workbooks by what they teach, and reads each
one's `.work` source live (`/<name>/source`) into a CodeMirror viewer. A `client` island + the
`design.work` brand sheet; no server block (it reads other mounts' source over HTTP).

## Run it

  WB_SERVE=1 PORT=4000 WB_DATA="$(pwd)/.." elixir --no-halt -S mix run   # mount the whole templates/ dir
  # then open /explore

It needs the other example workbooks mounted on the same nexus (so `/<name>/source` resolves).
